TITLE:: ProbeMeter
summary:: Compact, vertical real-time server level meter
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/Probe, Classes/ProbeMeterView, Classes/ServerMeter

DESCRIPTION::
ProbeMeter provides a compact, modernized vertical level meter for SuperCollider audio servers. It preserves the classic separated Input and Output channel strip arrangement while incorporating:

list::
## High-legibility dB tick ruler (0, -3, -6, -12, -18, -24, -36, -48, -60, -80 dBFS)
## Dynamic palette theming (Graphite, Phosphor, Ice, Amber, Paper, Monochrome)
## Three density presets (code::\micro::, code::\compact::, code::\extended::)
## Dual meter styles (code::\continuous:: and code::\led::)
## Peak-hold tracking with interactive click or keyboard ('r') reset
## Shared measurement broker: opening multiple meter windows never duplicates audio-server analysis synths
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates and displays a new ProbeMeter window.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target link::Classes/Server:: (defaults to code::Server.default::).

ARGUMENT:: numIns
Number of input channels to meter.

ARGUMENT:: numOuts
Number of output channels to meter.

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme name symbol (e.g. code::\graphite::) or link::Classes/ProbeTheme:: instance.

ARGUMENT:: density
Density preset: code::\micro::, code::\compact::, or code::\extended::.

ARGUMENT:: meterStyle
Meter display style: code::\continuous:: or code::\led::.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: window
Returns the underlying link::Classes/Window::.

METHOD:: meterView
Returns the underlying link::Classes/ProbeMeterView::.

METHOD:: theme
Changes the active theme dynamically without restarting analysis synths.

ARGUMENT:: aTheme
Theme symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme::.

METHOD:: density
Switches density mode and updates window dimensions.

ARGUMENT:: aDensity
Density symbol: code::\micro::, code::\compact::, or code::\extended::.

METHOD:: meterStyle
Switches between continuous and segmented LED styling.

ARGUMENT:: aStyle
Style symbol: code::\continuous:: or code::\led::.

METHOD:: fontScale
Get or set the active typography scaling factor.

ARGUMENT:: aScale
Float font scale between 0.6 and 2.5.

METHOD:: resetPeakHold
Resets peak-hold indicators to current levels.

METHOD:: close
Closes the meter window and unsubscribes from the broker.

EXAMPLES::

code::
s.boot;

// Default 2-in, 2-out compact meter in Graphite
m = Probe.meter(s, 2, 2);

// Switch themes dynamically
m.theme = \ice;
m.theme = \phosphor;

// Switch density
m.density = \micro;
m.density = \compact;

// Close
m.close;
::
